{
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.JellyGrapple.FortunatelyWithA": "Fortunately, with a heavy push, you use the water to sweep away the encroaching tentacles."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.JellyGrapple.NoMatterHow": "No matter how you try to swim away, you can't escape, getting caught up in it like a net!"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.JellyGrapple.RibbonLikeTendrils": "[pg]Ribbon-like tendrils float up to your sides as if carried by a current, and the displacement of the water when you move pulls them along with you. "
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.MolestPlayer.TheJellyGirl": "The jelly-girl trails a slick residue on you with her tongue while her small hands fondle your body."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.MolestPlayer.TheJellyGirl2": " The jelly-girl pulls you in, her stubby little body starting to explore yours!"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.MolestPlayer.TheMoreYou": "The more you move, the more you wrap yourself up in the myriad of ribbons and strings."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.MolestPlayer.WhileLookingAt": "While looking at you with innocent eyes, the stubby little slime girl starts licking you!"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.MolestPlayer.YouConserveYour": "You conserve your energy, submitting to the entanglement of molesting ribbons."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.OutputAttack.Text": " [b:Critical hit!]"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.OutputAttack.TheJellyGirl": "The jelly-girl twirls her bell, swinging her tentacles at you!"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.OutputAttack.Zero": "{0}"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.React.TheJellyGirl": "[pg-]The jelly-girl's membrane shudders as the energy passes through her."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.React.Zero": "{0}"
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.Struggle.WrithingAgainstThe": "Writhing against the grip, you maneuver well enough to thrust your [weapon] into the jelly-girl's bell, knocking the ruby core! She winces and releases you with a shocked look on her face."
  "Combat.JellyFishGirl.Struggle.YourStrugglesManage": "Your struggles manage to snap a tendril or two, but for naught, as you continue to be entangled."
}
